            <div class="data-wrapper">
                  <h3 class="ut-headline"><a href="/emergency-preparedness" class="ut-link--darker">Emergency Preparedness </a></h3>
                          <p>Weather in Central Texas can be unpredictable and possibly dangerous. From snow and ice to flash floods and anything in between, it’s always smart to be prepared.&nbsp;</p>
                          <a href="/emergency-preparedness" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" class="ut-link--darker">Get Prepared</a>
